{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44704","headline":"送戴三徵君还谷口旧居 · 理莹","name":"送戴三徵君还谷口旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩穴多遗秀，弓车屡远招。\n周王尊渭叟，颍客傲唐尧。\n出处天波洽，关河地势遥。\n瞻星吴郡夜，作雾华山朝。\n清论虚重席，闲居挂一瓢。\n渔歌思坐酌，宸渥宠行轺。\n春爲荷裳煖，霜因葛履消。\n层崖悬瀑溜，万壑振清飙。\n谷鸟犹迁木，场驹正食苗。\n谢安何日起，台鼎伫君调。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"理莹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}